    "summary": "Customer reports wrong item on K-6601 (Spice Route): ordered Paneer makhani ($15.00, item K-6601-1), received chicken makhani instead. Nobody ate it, no harm reported. Order placed 18:58 falls within open incident INC-311 (recalled curry sauce batch, covers orders 17:00-19:00). No compensation issued by frontline support; please handle via incident team."
