  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I'm sorry, but I can't speed up the incident team. They handle every affected order themselves, and I can't refund #K-6601 separately. Your case is filed, and a specialist will be in touch within 24 hours.\n\n**Order #K-6602 (extra naan):** This one I can handle now. It was placed at 7:02 PM, just after the recall window closed, so the incident doesn't cover it. You were charged for 2 garlic naans at $4.00 each. For the missing one, you can choose:\n\n1. **$4.00 refunded** to your Visa ending 4242, or\n2. **$4.80 in Forkful account credit** (the naan's price plus 20%), which you can use on future orders, including one tonight.\n\nIf you want to order more food before your guests arrive, the credit can go toward it. Which would you like? And what went wrong with #K-6603 from Lotus Garden?"
  },
