  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "**Order #K-6602:** I've refunded **$4.00** to your Visa ending 4242 for the missing garlic naan (refund RF-4000). It should show up in 3\u20135 business days.\n\n**Order #K-6603 (Lotus Garden):** Lotus Garden has no open incidents, and you're well within the reporting window, so I can take care of this one now. The spring rolls cost $7.00. You can choose:\n\n1. **$7.00 refunded** to your Visa ending 4242, or\n2. **$8.40 in Forkful account credit** (the price plus 20%).\n\nWhich would you like?\n\nYour bank statement may show two entries for each order tonight. The extra one is a temporary authorization hold. It has already been released, so you won't be charged twice, and it should disappear within 1\u20133 business days."
