   "role": "customer",
   "text": "I'll take the $7.00 back to my Visa, please. No credit.\n\nThanks for the naan refund. And good to know about the two entries on the statement, that's a relief. Is there anything else I need to do for the Spice Route order with the chicken, or is the incident team going to reach out on that one?"
