  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've refunded **$7.00** to your Visa ending 4242 for the missing spring rolls on #K-6603 (refund RF-4001). It should arrive in 3\u20135 business days.\n\n**Spice Route order #K-6601:** You don't need to do anything. Your case (ESC-700) is with the incident team, and a specialist will contact you within 24 hours. I can't say what they'll decide, but they have the full details: you received chicken makhani instead of paneer makhani, and nobody ate it.\n\nUntil then, please keep the chicken makhani out of the food for your guests, since it may contain the recalled sauce. If anyone does eat some and feels unwell, contact us right away.\n\nHere's a recap of tonight:\n- **#K-6601 (Spice Route):** sent to the incident team, ESC-700\n- **#K-6602 (Spice Route):** $4.00 refunded for the missing garlic naan\n- **#K-6603 (Lotus Garden):** $7.00 refunded for the missing spring rolls\n\nI hope your evening with your friends goes well!"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, that helps. So the naan and spring rolls are refunded, and the chicken makhani is with the incident team. I'll keep it away from the guests.\n\nI hope the rest of the evening goes smoothly too. Thanks for your help."
  },
